gentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened).', 'medium', 'Distributor''s own brand page with current products; not confirmed on Shimadzu''s site.', 'company', 'verified', '+81 75 823 1111', '', '1 Nishinokyo Kuwabara-cho, Nakagyo-ku, Kyoto 604-8511, Japan', '', 'HQ (official corporate profile 2025-26); no general email shown; US subsidiary Shimadzu Scientific Instruments, Columbia, MD: +1 410-381-1222 / +1 800-477-1227.');
