seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened).', 'high', 'Manufacturer''s own Israel page plus the distributor''s own site agree.', 'company', 'verified', '+1 614-438-4511', '', '1900 Polaris Parkway, Columbus, OH 43240, USA', '', 'HQ (Columbus, OH; address also on GlobalData profile). Operational HQ: Im Langacher 44, CH-8606 Greifensee, Switzerland — +41 44 944 22 11 (2014 annual report) / +41 44 944 45 45 (American Pharmaceutical Review). Phone numbers come from a 2014 report and directories — verify. No general email shown.');
