orius Stedim Biotech financial-statement note refers to ''Sartorius Israel Ltd. (51%)'' as not consolidated for materiality, so the legal entity may be a small, partly-owned company distinct from the Beit Haemek production business.', 'high', 'Israeli entity confirmed on manufacturer''s contact and subsidiaries pages; Labotal''s exclusivity for balances is self-reported.', 'company', 'verified', '+972 4 996 0595', '', 'Kibbutz Beit Haemek 2511500, Israel', 'https://www.sartorius.com/en/contact-us/local-contact', 'Israel office (Sartorius Israel, per third-party directory — fax +972 4 996 0043; not confirmed on sartorius.com, whose newsroom mentions an upgraded facility/new site for cell culture media production in Israel). HQ: Sartorius Campus, Otto-Brenner-Str. 20, 37079 Göttingen, Germany, +49 551 3080.');
