side the domain list. Status remains none_found.', 'low', 'Four different search angles found no Israeli entity; absence of evidence only.', 'company', 'partial', '+44 1865 393200', '', 'Tubney Woods, Abingdon, Oxfordshire OX13 5QX, UK', '', 'HQ. Address/phone per Sharecast and GlobalData profiles; fax +44 1865 393333; no general email seen.');
