 (fax +43 316 257 257); no general HQ email seen. Official page for Anton Paar Austria GmbH (sales & service Austria), Ankerstraße 6, 8054 Graz: +43 316 269 571, info.at@anton-paar.com (https://www.anton-paar.com/au-en/about-us/anton-paar-companies/anton-paar-austria-gmbh).');
