 own 2025 announcement (strong); size figures could not be sourced.', 'company', 'verified', '+41 71 353 85 85', 'info@metrohm.com', 'Ionenstrasse, 9100 Herisau, Switzerland', 'https://www.metrohm.com/en/company/how-to-find-us.html', 'HQ (Metrohm AG). Phone/address per the official ''How to find us'' page (fax +41 71 353 89 01); email per the official Company info page.');
