ied and may be a coincidence of names.', 'estimate', 'partial', '+49 2821 892-0', 'spectro.info@ametek.com', 'Boschstraße 10, 47533 Kleve, Germany', '', 'HQ. Address/phone per several directory listings (recyclinginside, yumda, fponthenet, jobvoting; fax +49 2821 892-2200); email from one older (2016-dated) listing - verify. US: 91 McKee Drive, Mahwah, NJ 07430, +1 201 642 3000 / +1 800 548 5809.');
