'https://analytik-jena.com/contact', 'HQ. Fax +49 3641 77-9279; sales +49 3641 77 7444 / sales@analytik-jena.com; service +49 3641 77 7407 / service@analytik-jena.com; press presse@analytik-jena.com (official contact pages).');
