page (via search summaries); size figures are aggregator estimates only.', 'estimate', 'verified', '+44 1223 627555', '', 'Melbourn Science Park, Melbourn, Hertfordshire SG8 6HB, UK', 'https://sptlabtech.com/contact', 'HQ. Official contact page; no general email shown (a legacy discover@ttplabtech.com appears on a third-party profile under the former company name TTP Labtech). CB Insights lists a different number +44 1763 262626.');
